sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant A as API
  participant E as Embedding worker
  participant D as SQLite
  participant L as LLM chain
  C->>A: POST /query {question, topK}
  A->>E: embed the question
  E-->>A: vector
  A->>D: read vectors (only when the data changed)
  A->>A: cosine, drop below the relevance floor, take top-k
  alt nothing relevant
    A-->>C: 200 "couldn't find anything", sources = []
  else relevant passages found
    A->>L: numbered passages + question
    Note over L: OpenAI, Groq, backup, extra provider, then a quoted passage
    L-->>A: answer with [n] citations
    A-->>C: 200 {answer, sources, answeredBy, notice?}
  end
